<main>
<section class="ops-intro" id="tiers"><h2 data-n="01">The two proposed tiers</h2>
  <p>Pia&rsquo;s itemised options and supplied photos, now with one Modena tote per gift at the quoted 100-unit rate. Presented for review; nothing is ordered.</p></section>
<div class="blk"><div class="inner">
  <div class="grid g2 proposed-tiers" id="itemised-hampers">
    <article class="sheet gift-tier" style="--a:var(--berry)" id="tier-one">
      <h4>Tier 1 &middot; Kathmandu Epiq</h4><span class="tag prem">Proposed premium tier</span>
      <div class="price">$311.87</div><p class="budget">Working item subtotal including Modena bag &middot; $400 budget target</p>
      <div class="jacket-deal" aria-label="Kathmandu Epiq recorded price comparison">
        <span>Original jacket price<s>$349.98</s></span><span>Member jacket price<b>$149.00</b></span>
        <span class="saving">Recorded saving: $200.98 per jacket</span>
      </div>
      <figure class="tier-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Pia's Tier 1 photo layout: black Kathmandu Epiq jacket, YETI bottle and tumbler, merino socks and two caps"><figcaption>Pia&rsquo;s supplied Tier 1 layout, updated with the current prices and running total. Actual supplier mockups for the branded jacket, Access Cap, socks and Modena tote are still pending, so the logo placement shown is a concept.</figcaption></figure>
      <table class="tier-items" aria-label="Tier 1 item prices"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th class="n">Each</th><th class="n">MOQ*</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/epiq-mns-down-jacket-v3-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kathmandu Men&rsquo;s Epiq Down Jacket</a><br><span class="small">Black &middot; non-hooded</span></td><td class="n">$149.00</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Small jacket logo embroidery</td><td class="n">$7.95</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Engraved YETI Rambler 36oz Bottle with Chug Cap</td><td class="n">$62.60</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Engraved YETI Rambler 10oz Tumbler</td><td class="n">$30.60</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Rizzi Australian Merino Wool Socks</td><td class="n">$16.83</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Embroidered Frame Foam Trucker Cap</td><td class="n">$16.38</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Embroidered Access Cap 1130</td><td class="n">$15.73</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="#packaging">Modena Jute Tote Bag with Colour Print</a><br><span class="small">One per gift &middot; 100-unit rate across both tiers</span></td><td class="n">$12.78</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
      <p class="remain">$88.13 left within the $400 target</p>
      <p class="small">For freight, setup, any tax adjustments and other remaining costs. An optional $47 wine allowance could instead fund produce or other items; it is not included in the $311.87 subtotal.</p>
      <p class="gift-total">50 allocated gifts &times; $311.87 = $15,593.50</p>
      <p class="small"><b>Note:</b> We currently have one extra large hamper, as most Tier 1 items have a minimum order quantity of 50. This is assuming we arrange a hamper locally in NZ for Fusion Fertiliser instead of shipping one of our Tier 1 hampers from Australia.</p>
      <details class="premium-alt" id="premium-alternative"><summary>Other Tier 1 jacket alternatives</summary><div class="alt-body">
        <p class="small">Jackets considered across our sourcing work and Nathan&rsquo;s Notion notes. Prices below were recorded 6&ndash;8 October 2026. The first two remain the main alternatives; the wider list shows the other models and versions checked, including those ruled out by colour, price or availability.</p>
        <div class="jacket-alt"><h5>1. The North Face Aconcagua 3</h5>
          <p><a href="https://www.anacondastores.com/en-au/p/the-north-face-mens-aconcagua-3-jacket/BP90220471-tnf-black-npf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Black &amp; NPF down jacket</a> &middot; <b>$199 Anaconda Club price</b>, normally $349.99.</p>
          <p>With the other Tier 1 items and Modena bag: <b>$361.87 per gift</b>, or <b>$18,093.50 for 50 gifts</b>, before remaining costs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt"><h5>2. The North Face Antora</h5>
          <p><a href="https://www.anacondastores.com/en-au/p/the-north-face-mens-antora-rain-jacket/90246702" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Black &amp; NPF rain jacket</a> &middot; <b>$183.99 sale price</b>, normally $229.99.</p>
          <p>With the other Tier 1 items and Modena bag: <b>$346.86 per gift</b>, or <b>$17,343.00 for 50 gifts</b>, before remaining costs.</p>
          <p class="small">Waterproof, windproof and uninsulated. The earlier check found limited sizes. <a href="https://findyourfeet.com.au/products/the-north-face-antora-jacket-mens" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Your Feet</a> recorded a $160 offer with very low black stock in S and XL.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt jacket-history-group"><h5>Further The North Face options</h5>
          <ul class="jacket-history">
            <li><a href="https://thenorthface.com.au/product/mens-aconcagua-3-hoodie/NF0A84I14H0.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aconcagua 3 Hoodie</a><span class="history-price">$300 sale; original $400</span><span class="small history-note">Black hooded down option.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://thenorthface.com.au/product/mens-terra-peak-jacket/NF0A88U2JK3.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Terra Peak Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$350 regular</span><span class="small history-note">Black synthetic jacket. The $280 sale applied to other colours.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://thenorthface.com.au/product/mens-descendit-jacket/NF0A87Y9KX7.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Descendit Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$350 sale; original $500</span><span class="small history-note">Black insulated snow jacket; a more specialised style.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.jd-sports.com.au/products/1996-retro-nuptse-puffer-jacket-120738463" target="_blank" rel="noopener">1996 Retro Nuptse Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$360 sale; original $550</span><span class="small history-note">Black offer found at JD Sports, but only XXXL was selectable. Nathan’s original notes recorded a $440 sale; that offer was not reconfirmed.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.anacondastores.com/en-au/c/mens-puffer-jackets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Classic Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$319.99 catalogue price</span><span class="small history-note">Listed out of stock; exact colour and individual product link were not retained.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt jacket-history-group"><h5>Kathmandu</h5>
          <ul class="jacket-history">
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/frisco-x-mns-down-hooded-jacket-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Frisco X Hooded Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$314.98 member; original $449.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black lifestyle option with a different fit and finish.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/epiq-mns-hooded-down-jacket-v2-black-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Epiq Hooded Down Jacket — Black/Black</a><span class="history-price">$159 member; original $399.98</span><span class="small history-note">The hooded Black/Black version; $10 above the proposed non-hooded Epiq.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/trailhead-2l-mns-novaloft-rain-jacket-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Trailhead 2L Insulated Rain Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$169 member; original $249.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray; waterproof shell with synthetic insulation.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-trailhead-3in1-rain-hooded-jacket-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Trailhead 3in1 Rain Hooded Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$349.98 regular</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray; rain shell with a removable fleece. No sale offer was recorded.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/epiq-mns-down-jacket-v3-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Epiq Down Jacket — Black</a><span class="history-price">$149 member; original $349.98</span><span class="small history-note">Current proposed jacket for both tiers; included here for the full comparison. Mixed-size supply still needs confirmation.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-retreat-down-jacket-washed-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Retreat Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$164.99 clearance; original $329.98</span><span class="small history-note">Washed Black rather than plain black. An earlier comparison recorded $197.99.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/pwdr-days-mns-down-snow-jacket-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PWDR-Days Down Snow Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$224.99 clearance; original $449.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray; L and XXL were unavailable at the check. Earlier comparison: $269.99.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-heli-down-jacket-v4-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Heli Down Jacket v4</a><span class="history-price">$109 member; original $239.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray; a lighter, lower-cost benchmark.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-heli-down-hooded-jacket-v3-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Heli Down Hooded Jacket 3.0</a><span class="history-price">$119 member; original $249.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray; another lightweight budget option.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/epiq-mns-hooded-down-jacket-v2-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Epiq Hooded Down Jacket — older Black version</a><span class="history-price">$149 clearance; displayed comparison $199.99</span><span class="small history-note">Black exterior with green lining; a different version from Black/Black. Only XL and XXL were marked available.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-epiq-down-hooded-parka-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Epiq Down Heritage Parka</a><span class="history-price">$239.99 sale; displayed comparison $479.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray, but only XS was marked available.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-epiq-waterproof-hooded-down-jacket-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Epiq Waterproof Hooded Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$419.98 member; original $599.98</span><span class="small history-note">Black waterproof down option; the jacket alone exceeds the $400 tier budget.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/mns-xt-series-cordura-lt-down-hooded-jacket-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">XT Series Cordura LT Down Hooded Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$549.98 regular</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray; above the Tier 1 budget.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/pwdr-days-2l-mns-3in1-snow-jacket-black-stingray" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PWDR-Days 2L 3-in-1 Snow Jacket</a><span class="history-price">Price not confirmed</span><span class="small history-note">Black Stingray search lead; the product data link returned “not found”. Availability was not established.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt jacket-history-group"><h5>R.M.Williams</h5>
          <ul class="jacket-history">
            <li><a href="https://marketplace.qantas.com/au/p/rm-williams-rydal-padded-jacket/2028749P/2028752" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rydal Padded Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$299 Qantas Marketplace cash price</span><span class="small history-note">Black synthetic padded option; Qantas Frequent Flyer login required. Low stock, larger sizes unavailable, and commercial gift quantities unconfirmed.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://theblokeshop.com.au/products/patterson-creek-jacket" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patterson Creek Jacket</a><span class="history-price">Price not confirmed</span><span class="small history-note">Black phone/in-store option; listed sizes did not include M, L, XL or 2XL. An indexed $199.95 price was not verified.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.rmwilliams.com.au/byrock-bomber-black-leather.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Byrock Bomber — Black Leather</a><span class="history-price">Price not confirmed</span><span class="small history-note">Official product link returned “not found”; old price and stock references could not be relied on.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://titleys.co/products/r-m-williams-padstow-primaloft-jacket" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Padstow Primaloft Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$349 product-card reference</span><span class="small history-note">Navy and Peat versions checked; neither met the black brief. The dedicated product price was not visible.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.rmwilliams.com.au/rockley-2-in-1-field-jacket-taslon-navy.html?lang=en_AU" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rockley 2 in 1 Field Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$399 retail benchmark</span><span class="small history-note">Navy rather than black. Nathan’s initial notes rounded this to $400; no corporate discount was secured.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt jacket-history-group"><h5>Macpac</h5>
          <ul class="jacket-history">
            <li><a href="https://www.macpac.com.au/macpac-mens-halo-down-jacket-/119143-BLK00-3XL.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Halo Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$119.99 sale; original $279.99</span><span class="small history-note">Black version; current Tier 2 budget fallback. Nathan’s initial notes rounded this to $120 / $280 and linked a different variant.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.macpac.com.au/macpac-mens-narvi-hooded-down-jacket-/122017.html?dwvar_122017_clearance=no&amp;dwvar_122017_color=Black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Narvi Hooded Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$219.99 recorded sale</span><span class="small history-note">Black hooded option used in the earlier Tier 1 proposal.</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.macpac.com.au/macpac-mens-sundowner-down-jacket/123627.html?dwvar_123627_clearance=no&amp;dwvar_123627_color=Black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sundowner Down Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$359.99 member, including GST</span><span class="small history-note">Black, with a removable hood. Water-resistant rather than waterproof; quantities and branding suitability unconfirmed.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt jacket-history-group"><h5>Patagonia</h5>
          <ul class="jacket-history">
            <li><a href="https://www.patagonia.com.au/products/mens-nano-puff-jacket-84213-blk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nano Puff Jacket</a><span class="history-price">$349.95 retail, including GST</span><span class="small history-note">Black lightweight synthetic option. Suitability for an additional Hybrid-Ag logo still needs confirmation.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt"><h5>Other styles screened</h5>
          <p class="small">These were collection listings rather than fully checked jacket options. <a href="https://www.rmwilliams.com.au/clothing/men/coats-jackets-vests?lang=en_AU" target="_blank" rel="noopener">R.M.Williams collection</a>:</p>
          <ul class="jacket-history">
            <li><b>Blyth Harrington</b> &middot; $449, Steel. Above budget and not black.</li>
            <li><b>Alton Harrington</b> &middot; $429, Khaki. Above budget and not black.</li>
            <li><b>Mardan Twill Bomber</b> &middot; $499, Fatigue. Above budget and not black.</li>
            <li><b>Rydal Padded Jacket</b> &middot; $299, Navy. A colour variant of the black option above.</li>
            <li><b>Rydal Padded Vest</b> &middot; $199, Black. A vest rather than a jacket.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="jacket-alt"><h5>Names still to confirm</h5>
          <p class="small">North Star: exact brand/model and price to confirm. Flemington: a search lead only; no matching R.M.Williams jacket was verified.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Recorded prices are planning references, not secured stock or bulk quotes. Confirm membership eligibility, available sizes, black colour, branding and a complete supply quote before ordering.</p>
      </div></details>
    </article>
    <article class="sheet gift-tier" style="--a:var(--teal)" id="tier-two">
      <h4>Tier 2 &middot; Kathmandu Epiq</h4><span class="tag std">Proposed standard tier</span>
      <div class="price">$208.78</div><p class="budget">Working item subtotal including Modena bag &middot; $200 budget target</p>
      <div class="jacket-deal" aria-label="Kathmandu Epiq recorded price comparison">
        <span>Original jacket price<s>$349.98</s></span><span>Member jacket price<b>$149.00</b></span>
        <span class="saving">Recorded saving: $200.98 per jacket</span>
      </div>
      <figure class="tier-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Tier 2 default: the same black Kathmandu Epiq jacket as Tier 1, engraved YETI tumbler and embroidered cotton baseball cap"><figcaption>Pia&rsquo;s supplied Kathmandu layout, updated with the current prices and running total. Kathmandu remains the Tier 2 default. Actual supplier mockups for the branded jacket, Modena tote and cotton baseball cap are still pending, so the logo placement shown is a concept.</figcaption></figure>
      <table class="tier-items" aria-label="Tier 2 Kathmandu item prices"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th class="n">Each</th><th class="n">MOQ*</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="https://www.kathmandu.com.au/products/epiq-mns-down-jacket-v3-black" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kathmandu Men&rsquo;s Epiq Down Jacket</a><br><span class="small">Black &middot; the same non-hooded jacket as Tier 1</span></td><td class="n">$149.00</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Small jacket logo embroidery</td><td class="n">$7.95</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Engraved YETI Rambler 10oz Tumbler</td><td class="n">$30.60</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Embroidered Cotton Baseball Cap</td><td class="n">$8.45</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="#packaging">Modena Jute Tote Bag with Colour Print</a><br><span class="small">One per gift &middot; 100-unit rate across both tiers</span></td><td class="n">$12.78</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
      <p class="remain over">$8.78 over the $200 target before remaining costs</p>
      <p class="small">Includes the Modena bag, with its setup fee and freight. Freight, setup and any tax adjustments for the other items still need costing; review the overrun or use the Macpac alternative below.</p>
      <p class="gift-total">83 allocated gifts &times; $208.78 = $17,328.74</p>
      <div class="tier-upgrade">
        <h5>Lower-cost alternative &middot; Macpac Halo</h5>
        <div class="upgrade-price">$171.98 <span>per gift &middot; save $36.80</span></div>
        <p>If we need to reduce the budget, swap only the jacket for the black <a href="https://www.macpac.com.au/macpac-mens-halo-down-jacket-/119143-BLK00-3XL.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Macpac Halo at $112.20 incl. GST</a> &mdash; a discounted bulk quote of $102 ex GST for 83 units, down from $119. Embroidery, tumbler, cap and Modena bag stay the same: $59.78 combined.</p>
        <figure class="tier-photo"><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Tier 2 lower-cost alternative: black Macpac Halo jacket, engraved YETI tumbler and embroidered cotton baseball cap"><figcaption>Pia&rsquo;s supplied Macpac layout, now the secondary option. The layout uses the discounted $112.20 incl. GST bulk quote. Actual supplier mockups for the branded jacket, Modena tote and cotton baseball cap are still pending, so the logo placement shown is a concept.</figcaption></figure>
        <p class="remain">$28.02 left within the $200 target</p>
        <p class="gift-total">83 allocated gifts &times; $171.98 = $14,274.34</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <details class="premium-alt" style="margin-top:20px">
    <summary>More Tier 2 options &middot; larger YETI bottle variants</summary>
    <div class="alt-body">
      <div class="jacket-alt"><h5>Tier 2 hamper &middot; Option 3 &middot; Macpac jacket + YETI 18oz &middot; $201.02</h5>
        <figure class="tier-photo"><img src="assets/hampers-2026/tier-2-hamper-option-3.jpg" alt="Tier 2 hamper Option 3: Macpac Halo down jacket, YETI 18oz bottle, cotton baseball cap, Rizzi merino socks and Modena tote bag"></figure>
        <table class="tier-items" aria-label="Tier 2 Option 3 item prices"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th class="n">Each</th><th class="n">MOQ*</th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr><td><a href="https://www.macpac.com.au/macpac-mens-halo-down-jacket-/119143-BLK00-3XL.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Macpac Men&rsquo;s Halo Down Jacket</a><br><span class="small">Discounted quote, $102 ex GST &times; 83 units; $119 original</span></td><td class="n">$112.20</td><td class="n">83</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Logo embroidery</td><td class="n">$7.95</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Engraved YETI Rambler 18oz Bottle with Chug Cap</td><td class="n">$46.60</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Embroidered Cotton Baseball Cap</td><td class="n">$8.45</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Rizzi Australian Merino Wool Socks</td><td class="n">$13.04</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#packaging">Modena Jute Tote Bag with Colour Print</a></td><td class="n">$12.78</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
        </tbody></table>
        <p class="remain over">$1.02 over the $200 target</p>
        <p class="gift-total">83 allocated gifts &times; $201.02 = $16,684.66</p>
      </div>
      <div class="jacket-alt"><h5>Tier 2 hamper &middot; Option 4 &middot; Macpac jacket + YETI 26oz &middot; $209.02</h5>
        <figure class="tier-photo"><img src="assets/hampers-2026/tier-2-hamper-option-4.jpg" alt="Tier 2 hamper Option 4: Macpac Halo down jacket, YETI 26oz bottle, cotton baseball cap, Rizzi merino socks and Modena tote bag"></figure>
        <table class="tier-items" aria-label="Tier 2 Option 4 item prices"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th class="n">Each</th><th class="n">MOQ*</th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr><td><a href="https://www.macpac.com.au/macpac-mens-halo-down-jacket-/119143-BLK00-3XL.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Macpac Men&rsquo;s Halo Down Jacket</a><br><span class="small">Discounted quote, $102 ex GST &times; 83 units; $119 original</span></td><td class="n">$112.20</td><td class="n">83</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Logo embroidery</td><td class="n">$7.95</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Engraved YETI Rambler 26oz Bottle with Chug Cap</td><td class="n">$54.60</td><td class="n">50</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Embroidered Cotton Baseball Cap</td><td class="n">$8.45</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Rizzi Australian Merino Wool Socks</td><td class="n">$13.04</td><td class="n">100</td></tr>
