  <h3 class="sub">Parked &amp; stretch &mdash; revisit only if the runway is clean</h3>
  <div class="grid g3 rot">
    <div class="sheet"><h4>Event-invite tier</h4><p>A Premium crate that includes an invite &mdash; knowledge day, cricket, or the EOY review. The biggest potency-add on the list; budget decides.</p></div>
    <div class="sheet"><h4>Early-access AI-Ag QR</h4><p>Premium-tier preview login to the platform. Conditional on the Application Buildout&rsquo;s September state.</p></div>
