    <div class="sheet"><h4>Territory manager map</h4><p>Print insert showing coverage + team. Carried from 2025 &mdash; only if everything else lands.</p></div>
    <div class="sheet"><h4>&ldquo;Year in Review&rdquo; client event</h4><p>James White&rsquo;s half-day gathering tied to hamper delivery. Bigger than a stretch item &mdash; scope separately.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="src">
    <h3 class="sub">Sources &amp; working documents</h3>
